" the empty salt)."
msgstr "**路径参数:** ``cache_salt`` — 租户标识符 (``_default`` 表示空盐)。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:405
msgid "``limit_gb``"
msgstr "``limit_gb``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:406
msgid "float"
msgstr "浮点数"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:407
