msgstr "``422``: 请求体未通过字段级验证。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:436
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``DELETE /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``DELETE /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:438
msgid ""
"Remove a salt's quota entry. Any bytes still cached under it become over-"
"budget on the next eviction cycle (effective limit drops to ``0``)."
msgstr "删除盐的配额条目。任何仍然缓存的字节将在下一个逐出周期变为超出预算（有效限制降至 ``0``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:444
msgid ""
"**Query parameters:** ``tier`` — optional (default ``l2``); cache tier "
"the quota applies to."
msgstr "**查询参数:** ``tier`` — 可选（默认 ``l2``）；配额适用的缓存层级。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:453
msgid ""
"When no quota was registered for the salt, ``status`` is "
"``\"not_found\"`` (still ``200 OK``)."
msgstr "当未为盐注册配额时，``status`` 为 ``\"not_found\"``（仍然是 ``200 OK``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:458
msgid "``200``: removed, or ``not_found`` if no quota existed."
msgstr "``200``: 已移除，或 ``not_found`` 如果不存在配额。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:468
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``GET /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:470
msgid "Read the quota and live usage for a single salt."
msgstr "读取单个盐的配额和实时使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:475 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:503
msgid "**Query parameters:** ``tier`` — optional (default ``l2``)."
msgstr "**查询参数:** ``tier`` — 可选（默认 ``l2``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:483
msgid ""
"``quota_limit_gb`` is the configured limit in GiB (``0.0`` when no quota "
"is set), ``quota_exists`` whether an explicit quota is registered, and "
"``usage_gb`` the current aggregate usage. This endpoint never returns "
"``404`` for an unknown salt."
msgstr "``quota_limit_gb`` 是以 GiB 为单位的配置限制（当未设置配额时为 ``0.0``），``quota_exists`` 表示是否注册了显式配额，``usage_gb`` 是当前的总使用量。此端点对于未知的 salt 永远不会返回 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:489
msgid "``200``: quota and usage reported."
msgstr "``200``: 报告配额和使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:499
msgid "``GET /quota``"
msgstr "``GET /quota``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:501
msgid "List total usage and a per-salt breakdown."
msgstr "列出总使用量和每个 salt 的详细信息。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:516
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``total_gb`` is aggregate usage across all salts in GiB; each "
"``by_cache_salt`` entry has the same fields as the ``GET "
"/quota/{cache_salt}`` response."
msgstr "``total_gb`` 是所有 salt 的总使用量（以 GiB 为单位）；每个 ``by_cache_salt`` 条目具有与 ``GET /quota/{cache_salt}`` 响应相同的字段。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:521
msgid "``200``: usage reported."
msgstr "``200``: 报告的使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:531
msgid "``POST /quota/events``"
msgstr "``POST /quota/events``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:533
msgid ""
"Ingest a batch of usage events. Sent automatically by reporting MP "
"servers; not usually called by hand."
msgstr "摄取一批使用事件。由报告 MP 服务器自动发送；通常不手动调用。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:547
msgid "The MP server that produced this batch."
msgstr "生成此批次的 MP 服务器。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:548
msgid "``seq``"
msgstr "``seq``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:550
msgid ""
"Monotonic per-instance sequence number (``>= 1``); supports future gap "
"detection of lost batches."
msgstr "每个实例的单调序列号（``>= 1``）；支持未来丢失批次的间隙检测。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:554
msgid "Optional (default ``l2``). Cache tier the events apply to."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``l2``）。事件适用的缓存层。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:555
msgid "``events``"
msgstr "``events``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:556
msgid "list[object]"
msgstr "列表[对象]"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:557
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The events to record. Each is ``{\"type\", \"key\", \"bytes\"}``: "
"``type`` is ``\"store\"``, ``\"lookup\"``, or ``\"delete\"``; ``key`` is "
"the encoded object key; ``bytes`` (``>= 0``) is the stored size — counted"
" for ``store`` and ignored for ``lookup`` / ``delete`` (a ``delete`` "
"subtracts the size recorded at the original ``store``)."
msgstr "要记录的事件。每个事件为 ``{\\\"type\\\", \\\"key\\\", \\\"bytes\\\"}``： ``type`` 为 ``\\\"store\\\"``、``\\\"lookup\\\"`` 或 ``\\\"delete\\\"``； ``key`` 是编码后的对象键； ``bytes`` (``>= 0``) 是存储的大小 — 对于 ``store`` 计入，对于 ``lookup`` / ``delete`` 忽略（``delete`` 会减去在原始 ``store`` 记录的大小）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:569
msgid "``recorded`` is the number of events processed."
msgstr "``recorded`` 是处理的事件数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:573
msgid "``200``: events processed."
msgstr "``200``: 处理的事件数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:594
msgid "Cache control"
msgstr "缓存控制"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:596
msgid ""
"The ``/cache`` group dispatches cache operations to a named MP server. "
"Today it covers **warm prefetch**; further cache-control operations will "
"be documented as endpoints here as they land."
msgstr "``/cache`` 组将缓存操作分派给命名的 MP 服务器。今天它涵盖 **热预取**；进一步的缓存控制操作将在此处作为端点记录。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:600
msgid ""
"**Warm prefetch (pre-loading L1 from L2).** Pre-warm one MP server's L1 "
"with the KV for a known prompt **before** the requests arrive, so the "
"first request hits L1 instead of paying the L2 fetch inline -- useful "
"when you know a workload is about to be routed to a node (a traffic "
"shift, a hot shared system prompt)."
msgstr "**热预取（从 L2 预加载 L1）。** 在请求到达之前，用已知提示的 KV 预热一个 MP 服务器的 L1，以便第一个请求命中 L1，而不是支付 L2 内联获取的费用——当您知道工作负载即将路由到节点（流量转移、热共享系统提示）时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:605
msgid ""
"You describe the content by **token ids** -- the unit the cache speaks --"
" never by internal cache keys, which you cannot construct (a key is a "
"content hash plus a per-rank layout bitmap). The coordinator forwards the"
" request to the named server, which hashes the tokens, expands them "
"across the node's ranks, loads the chunks from L2 into L1, and "
"**retains** them so a later lookup hits. The submit returns a "
"``request_id``; poll the status endpoint until ``completed``. The warm "
"acquires no lock -- the poll simply reports progress and clears the "
"server-side job once the load finishes."
msgstr "您通过 **token ids** 描述内容——缓存使用的单位——而不是通过内部缓存键，您无法构造这些键（键是内容哈希加上每个排名的布局位图）。协调器将请求转发到指定的服务器，该服务器对令牌进行哈希，将它们扩展到节点的各个排名，从 L2 加载块到 L1，并 **保留** 它们，以便后续查找命中。提交返回一个 ``request_id``；轮询状态端点直到 ``completed``。预热不需要获取锁——轮询仅报告进度，并在加载完成后清除服务器端作业。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:615
msgid "``POST /cache/prefetches``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/prefetches``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:617
msgid "Submit a warm prefetch of a token sequence on one named server."
msgstr "在一个指定的服务器上提交一个令牌序列的预热预取。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:630
msgid "Target MP server; must be registered."
msgstr "目标 MP 服务器；必须已注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:631
msgid "``model_name``"
msgstr "``model_name``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:633
msgid "Model whose layout sizes the target's L1 buffers."
msgstr "目标的 L1 缓冲区布局大小的模型。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:634
msgid "``world_size``"
msgstr "``world_size``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:636
msgid ""
"World size (``>= 1``) selecting the KV layout and the per-rank fan-out "
"(``1`` for a single-GPU, TP=1 deployment)."
msgstr "世界大小（``>= 1``），选择 KV 布局和每个 rank 的扇出（对于单 GPU，TP=1 部署为 ``1``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:638
msgid "``token_ids``"
msgstr "``token_ids``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:639
msgid "list[int]"
msgstr "列表[int]"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:640
msgid ""
"Prompt tokens whose complete ``chunk_size`` chunks are warmed; must match"
" what was stored (same tokenizer / special tokens). A sub-chunk sequence "
"is a ``noop``."
msgstr "完全 ``chunk_size`` 块的提示令牌已预热；必须与存储的内容匹配（相同的分词器/特殊令牌）。子块序列是 ``noop``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:643
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``cache_salt``"
msgstr "``cache_salt``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:645
msgid ""
"Optional (default ``\"\"``). Per-tenant isolation salt applied to the "
"produced keys."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``\"\"``）。应用于生成键的每个租户隔离盐。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:654
msgid ""
"When the sequence is shorter than one chunk, nothing is submitted and "
"``request_id`` is empty:"
msgstr "当序列短于一个块时，什么都不会被提交，``request_id`` 为空："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:661
msgid ""
"``request_id`` is the id to poll; ``chunks`` is the number of whole "
"chunks submitted to warm."
msgstr "``request_id`` 是用于轮询的 ID；``chunks`` 是提交的完整块的数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:666
msgid "``200``: submitted (or a ``noop`` as above)."
msgstr "``200``：已提交（或如上所述的 ``noop``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:667
msgid "``404``: unknown ``instance_id`` (not registered)."
msgstr "``404``: 未知 ``instance_id``（未注册）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:668
msgid "``502``: the target server was unreachable or rejected the submit."
msgstr "``502``: 目标服务器无法访问或拒绝了提交。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:673
msgid ""
"**Single-node scope:** one ``instance_id`` warms only that node's shards."
" For a model sharded across multiple nodes, submit one request per node's"
" instance."
msgstr "**单节点范围：** 一个 ``instance_id`` 仅对该节点的分片进行预热。对于跨多个节点的模型，每个节点的实例需提交一个请求。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:692
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /cache/prefetches/{instance_id}/{request_id}``"
msgstr "``GET /cache/prefetches/{instance_id}/{request_id}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:694
msgid ""
"Poll a submitted warm prefetch; the response relays the owning server's "
"status verbatim with its code."
msgstr "轮询已提交的预热预取；响应将拥有服务器的状态及其代码逐字传递。"

